~ start
Puck The Merchant: Coren![wait=0.2] Business is slow,[wait=0.3] but the road is never quiet.
=> menu

~ menu
Puck The Merchant: What can I do for you?
- What are you selling?
	=> shop
- Heard any rumors?
	Puck The Merchant: Folk out east whisper about ruins...[wait=0.3] with machines still humming inside.
	Puck The Merchant: Your girl Faith asked me the same thing, you know.
	=> END
- Goodbye.
	Puck The Merchant: Safe travels, friend.
	=> END

~ shop
Puck The Merchant: Take a look. Everything's priced fair...mostly[wait=0.6]. 
- {{get_listing(0)}} [if not is_sold_out(0)]
	if buy(0)
		Puck The Merchant: Pleasure doing business, friend.
	else
		Puck The Merchant: You're short on {{get_currency_name(0)}}.
	=> END
- {{get_listing(1)}} [if not is_sold_out(1)]
	if buy(1)
		Puck The Merchant: Pleasure doing business, friend.
	else
		Puck The Merchant: You're short on {{get_currency_name(1)}}.
	=> END
- Never mind.
	Puck The Merchant: Suit yourself.
	=> END